cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this app, please cite this repository."
title: "Genomics Workflow Microbials"
abstract: >-
  Desktop app (Windows, Mac, Linux) that types bacterial isolates from paired
  Illumina reads. It runs the Galaxy Australia workflow "Genomic Assembly and
  analysis - RDH version 6" without Galaxy, with every tool in its own
  container at a fixed version and every tool and database version recorded
  for traceability. Workflows can be built in the app or imported from
  Galaxy, and tools added from GitHub.
authors:
  - alias: "TinusTK"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: MIT
type: software
